\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\taxon{Example}
\title{Small training-law error can reverse evaluation selection}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{ledger}

\p{In the two-point construction of \ref{ftip-007J}, training-law average
error is small while evaluation selection reverses. The missing hypothesis is
a uniform bound on the evaluated feasible set; an informal promise of similar
distributions does not supply it.}
